!!! Constructing a type nothing declares.
!!!
!!! This compiled silently, and ran, and the only sign of trouble was a later
!!! "has no member" on the value it produced -- which sends the author to the
!!! type's definition when the real fault is a misspelled name or a file that
!!! was never given to the compiler. It cost a project several turns and a
!!! wrong conclusion about how imports work.
book diagnostic.unknown-type

main returns number begin paragraph
    value panel is build rectangle with width being 3, height being 4
    give 0
end paragraph
